"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":350,"closed_issues":2337,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:02Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-19T08:02:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:55:45Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T22:55:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\nv4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\nv4.5.dev3.official [55fc6e73f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 22621) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3713) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13620H (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUnlike AudioEffectAmplify, the panning is not interpolated over the frame, which makes crackle when it changes\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nChange the panning of an AudioEffectPanner of an active bus, also works in editor\n\nSolution is very simple:\n\n\nIn audio_effect_panner.cpp change\n\n```\nvoid AudioEffectPannerInstance::process(const AudioFrame *p_src_frames, AudioFrame *p_dst_frames, int p_frame_count) {\n\tfloat lvol = CLAMP(1.0 - base->pan, 0, 1);\n\tfloat rvol = CLAMP(1.0 + base->pan, 0, 1);\n\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < p_frame_count; i++) {\n\t\tp_dst_frames[i].left = p_src_frames[i].left * lvol + p_src_frames[i].right * (1.0 - rvol);\n\t\tp_dst_frames[i].right = p_src_frames[i].right * rvol + p_src_frames[i].left * (1.0 - lvol);\n\t}\n}\n```\nto\n```\nvoid AudioEffectPannerInstance::process(const AudioFrame *p_src_frames, AudioFrame *p_dst_frames, int p_frame_count) {\n\n    float pan = base->pan;\n    float p = mix_pan;\n    float pan_inc = (pan - mix_pan) / float(p_frame_count);\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < p_frame_count; i++) {\n        float lvol = CLAMP(1.0 - p, 0, 1);\n        float rvol = CLAMP(1.0 + p, 0, 1);\n\t\tp_dst_frames[i].left = p_src_frames[i].left * lvol + p_src_frames[i].right * (1.0 - rvol);\n\t\tp_dst_frames[i].right = p_src_frames[i].right * rvol + p_src_frames[i].left * (1.0 - lvol);\n        p += pan_inc;\n    }\n    mix_pan = base->pan;\n}\n```\nand in audio_effect_panner.h at AudioEffectPannerInstance add\n\n`float mix_pan;`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Pan Test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20279554/Pan.Test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106587/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106587/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}